  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Add 1/2 the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add white rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce the heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from the heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-672364bc06f5566883435ce7-a8aa5bea.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons.\n• Trim and halve green beans.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-672364bc06f5566883435ce7-770e6c0d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook carrot and green beans, tossing, until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Stir in chickpeas, ginger paste, curry spice blend, Masala spice blend, tomato paste and remaining garlic, and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-672364bc06f5566883435ce7-c34bfc8c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in coconut milk. Simmer until slightly reduced, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in baby spinach. Stir until wilted, 1 min. Season to taste.\n• Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with Indian chickpea curry.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-672364bc06f5566883435ce7-9cb4d9c0.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
